{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grammar Grind is a relaxing word building incremental all about scoring big and flexing your vocabulary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055870/extras/9804b38105416abf96cef2a9685af83c.poster.avif?t=1759984241\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055870/extras/9804b38105416abf96cef2a9685af83c.webm?t=1759984241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055870/extras/9804b38105416abf96cef2a9685af83c.mp4?t=1759984241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Goal is Simple:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Tiles to spell valid Words and earn Score based on the value of the Tiles used. Earn more points for using special Tiles. Unlock &amp; upgrade even more special Tiles by spending the points you earned and then spell even more words! Repay your 1,000,000,000 point debt by playing massive words with huge bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 148,000 English words supported!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Special Tiles with unique interactions and abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >0.0001% Interest!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055870?t=1759984241","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055870/d893c3af3de6f482ca1f343ae0eca55f947519a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759984241","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055870/e4c67aa7ee0c05c95d09f396d25e34792c517de3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759984241","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto